HUSH Unified DAW — Full Prompt Sequence to Completion



This is the complete, ordered prompt set from 0.2 through a finished product. Hand them to a coding agent or team one at a time, in order. Each prompt is self-contained and ends with a gate that must pass before the next begins. Do not merge prompts. Do not skip gates.



The overall arc:



· 0.2 — Persistence + real-time Linux engine + bus routing (headless)

· 0.3 — Mixer GUI, then arrangement view

· 0.4 — Recording, takes, comping, punch

· 0.5 — MIDI, pattern sequencing, clip launcher, scenes

· 0.6 — VST3 plugin hosting

· 0.7 — Windows platform parity

· 0.8 — Automation, undo hardening, project interchange (AAF/OMF/RPP converters)

· 0.9 — HUSH voice / AOC Magic integration

· 1.0 — Release hardening, macOS, docs, installer



Each prompt follows the same shape: Goal → Contracts to lock → Implementation → Gates → Deliverables → Do-not-ship list. This mirrors the discipline that made 0.1.0 and 0.2 trustworthy.



